The Eighth Judicial District Court of Clark County encompasses all municipalities and outlying communities of Clark County. The court serves more than 2.2 million citizens as the trial court for Nevada and is part of the judicial branch of state government as set forth by the Nevada Constitution. The 58 elected"/>
				
